sequenceDiagram
    participant CC as Claude Code session
    participant LC as live-compact plugin
    participant API as Claude API

    Note over CC: You keep working, the context grows

    loop Every 5 seconds
        LC->>CC: Read the context size and the auto-compact threshold
        CC-->>LC: For example 330k of 367k tokens
    end

    Note over LC: Context is within 40k tokens of the threshold
    LC->>API: Background fork: same model and transcript,<br/>asked only for a summary
    Note over CC: Your turn keeps running, no wait
    API-->>LC: Summary, kept with the last message the fork saw

    Note over CC: Context reaches the threshold: auto-compaction starts
    CC->>LC: session.compact hook

    alt Summary ready and its last message still in the conversation
        LC-->>CC: New conversation: summary, transcript path, skills,<br/>then every newer message word for word
        Note over CC: Session continues in about 10-20 ms<br/>Transcript line: "live-compact: compacted..."
    else No summary yet, or the conversation was rewound
        LC->>CC: Hand over to standard compaction
        CC->>API: Summarize the whole conversation
        API-->>CC: Summary, usually after 1-3 minutes
        Note over CC: Session continues after the wait
    end
